source_text:
\begin{proof}
Let $\delta$ be !!a{derivation} of $!A(c)$ from $\Gamma$.  By adding a
\Intro{\lforall} inference, we obtain !!a{derivation} of
$\lforall[x][!A(x)]$. Since $c$ does not occur in $\Gamma$ or $!A(x)$,
the eigenvariable condition is satisfied.
\end{proof}

