\ollabel{prop:ccs}
Suppose $\Gamma$ is !!{complete} and consistent. Then:
\begin{enumerate}
\item \ollabel{prop:ccs-prov-in} If $\Gamma \Proves !A$, then $!A \in
  \Gamma$.

standard_text:
