ordinary_text:
\begin{proof}
Neem een consistente verzameling $\Gamma$. Zet $!A_0$, $!A_1$,
\dots{} in één lijst met alle !!{sentence}s van~$\Lang L$. Begin met
$\Gamma_0 = \Gamma$ en definieer
\[
\Gamma_{n+1} =
\begin{cases}
\Gamma_n \cup \{ !A_n \} & \textrm{als $\Gamma_n \cup \{!A_n\}$
  consistent is;} \\
\Gamma_n \cup \{ \lnot !A_n \} & \textrm{anders.}
\end{cases}
\]
Neem ten slotte $\Gamma^* = \bigcup_{n \geq 0} \Gamma_n$.

source_text:
\begin{proof}
Let $\Gamma$ be consistent.  Let $!A_0$, $!A_1$,
\dots{} be an enumeration of all the !!{sentence}s of~$\Lang L$.
Define $\Gamma_0 = \Gamma$, and
\[
\Gamma_{n+1} =
\begin{cases}
\Gamma_n \cup \{ !A_n \} & \textrm{if $\Gamma_n \cup \{!A_n\}$ is
  consistent;} \\
\Gamma_n \cup \{ \lnot !A_n \} & \textrm{otherwise.}
\end{cases}
\]
Let $\Gamma^* = \bigcup_{n \geq 0} \Gamma_n$.

