\begin{defn}[Immediate !!^{subformula}]
If $!A$ is !!a{formula}, the \emph{immediate !!{subformula}s}
of $!A$ are defined inductively as follows:
\begin{enumerate}
\item Atomic !!{formula}s have no immediate !!{subformula}s.

ordinary_text:
