If an $\Lang{L}$-!!{structure}~$\Struct{M}$ is a reduct of an
$\Lang{L'}$-!!{structure}~$\Struct{M'}$, then for all
$\Lang{L}$-!!{sentence}s~$!A$,
\[
\Sat{M}{!A} \text{ iff } \Sat{M'}{!A}.
\]
\end{prop}

